<title>FRANCE: Sanofi Q1 sales up five pct.</title>
<headline>Sanofi Q1 sales up five pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 5,683    vs    5,435</p>
<p>     - Health					4,979    vs    4,729</p>
<p>     - Beauty products			     704    vs	706</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanofi, a unit of Elf Aquitaine, said in a statement that first-quarter sales rose five percent, reflecting a five percent rise in its main pharmaceuticals business.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
